  "summary": [
    "Prediction-market evidence anchored near 60–65% odds for turnover within 2026 provides a substantial baseline.",
    " A credible death event on Feb 28, 2026 vacates the post and triggers formal succession processes, sharply increasing turnover likelihood in the near term.",
    " Economic crisis, civil unrest, and regional pressure further reinforce upward pressure on leadership change within the target window.",
